  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3208.03 Inspection Fee Sign",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-01-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3208.03 Inspection Fee Sign.\n\n(a) Each sign shall be no less than 12 inches in height by 18 inches in length, bearing the words:\n\nVEHICLE INSPECTION\n\nFEE $________\n\n(b) Each letter and number shall be at least 2 inches in height with at least a 3/8 inch brush stroke.\n\n(c) Each inspection station shall enter the appropriate fee in the space provided.\n\n(d) More than one sign may be posted.\n\n(e) If the inspection fee includes a separate fee for an OBD-II inspection, the inspection station shall break down the 2 fees on one sign, pursuant to RSA 266:1, VII. This sign shall not be subject to the requirements set forth in (b) above.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3200.html"
